From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DADAO Architecture <dadao@example.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hw: register dadao subdir in hw/meson.build

Without this line hw/dadao/meson.build is never executed, so
dadao-machine.c is never compiled and the machine type never registered.
Insert subdir('dadao') in alphabetical order (after 'cxl').

---
 hw/meson.build | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/hw/meson.build b/hw/meson.build
index b91f761..7cf00df 100644
--- a/hw/meson.build
+++ b/hw/meson.build
@@ -7,6 +7,7 @@ subdir('char')
 subdir('core')
 subdir('cpu')
 subdir('cxl')
+subdir('dadao')
 subdir('display')
 subdir('dma')
 subdir('gpio')
-- 
